  "label": "tired boss",
  "description": "A meme template that uses the image of a weary-looking Black man (often identified as Mookie from 'Do the Right Thing' or a similar figure) to convey exhaustion or resignation. The term 'boss' implies authority or responsibility, and the phrase 'I'm tired' suggests being overwhelmed. This is a cultural meme format that relies on the visual of a Black man to represent a figure of authority or burden, which can be racially stereotyping.",
